{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Iterator","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The elements returned by this iterator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appear in the order that the tasks "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"completed"}]},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not in the order that those tasks were added to the task group."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This iterator terminates after all tasks have completed successfully,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or after any task completes by throwing an error."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a task completes by throwing an error,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it doesn’t return any further task results."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"After iterating over the results of each task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it’s valid to make a new iterator for the task group,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which you can use to iterate over the results of new tasks you add to the group."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can also make a new iterator to resume iteration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after a child task throws an error."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["group.addTask { 1 }","group.addTask { throw SomeError }","group.addTask { 2 }","","do {","    \/\/ Assuming the child tasks complete in order, this prints \"1\"","    \/\/ and then throws an error.","    for try await r in group { print(r) }","} catch {","    \/\/ Resolve the error.","}","","\/\/ Assuming the child tasks complete in order, this prints \"2\".","for try await r in group { print(r) }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"See Also","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ThrowingTaskGroup.next()"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ThrowingTaskGroup\/Iterator\/cancel()","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ThrowingTaskGroup\/Iterator\/next()","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ThrowingTaskGroup\/Iterator\/next(isolation:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ThrowingTaskGroup\/Iterator\/Element"],"title":"Type Aliases","anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ThrowingTaskGroup\/Iterator\/AsyncIteratorProtocol-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChildTaskResult"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Failure"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Iterator"}],"modules":[{"name":"Swift","relatedModules":[]}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":fals